From: Duron27 <duron27@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Player markers: no more flicker, minimap and global map, toggles, orange for the group and green for everyone else

- engine: markers for other players were rebuilt every refresh (destroyed and recreated every 0.5 s), so they popped in
  and out. The list now only rebuilds when the set of players, cells or colours changes; otherwise the widgets are moved
- global map: players who are outdoors are shown there too (and follow the zoom)
- PlayerMarker { marker, group, exterior }; ui.setMapMarkers takes group = true for orange (green otherwise)
- Lua: settings and /markers /arrows [on|off] toggle the map markers and the arrows; the arrows are orange for the group too
  (mp_arrow_group.tga)
- any change to a multiplayer setting used to reconnect the whole session; display and sharing settings now apply live

